   "title": "光源",
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>故障排除：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/trdfri-te4-lu3-fei1-ying1-yong4-cheng2-xu4-yu3-wang3-guan1-pub7aa79e20\">TR&Aring;DFRI 特鲁菲 应用程序与网关</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/guang1-yuan2-pub39b8ed93\">光源</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.ikea.cn/cn/zh/customer-service/kong4-zhi4-zhuang1-zhi4-pubc74b6197\">控制装置</a></p>",
    "光源",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/25/38/2538c493bd104a21d6efff4a82d323a8.png"
   ],
